1. Definitions

1.1 "The Software" means the source code, configuration files, scripts,
    documentation and accompanying assets contained in this repository
    (sst-music), and any derivative work thereof.

1.2 "Copyright Holder" means lanlan0811 (GitHub: https://github.com/lanlan0811).

1.3 "Commercial Use" means any use for commercial advantage or monetary
    compensation, including without limitation:
    (a) selling, renting or licensing the Software or derivative works;
    (b) charging third parties for the Software as part of a product or
        service;
    (c) distributing through app stores (including but not limited to
        Google Play, the App Store, Android marketplaces, or mini-program
        platforms) with paid downloads, in-app purchases, advertising,
        or traffic monetization;
    (d) offering paid hosting, SaaS, subscription, consulting or support
        services based on the Software;
    (e) use within a commercial organization in revenue-generating
        production operations;
    (f) using the Software as a traffic funnel to paid products or
        commercial services;
    (g) paid commissioning to build, deploy, customize or operate the
        Software for a third party.

1.4 The following are NOT Commercial Use:
    (a) personal study, research, experimentation and private use;
    (b) use in teaching, academic research, or non-profit open-source
        projects;
    (c) internal non-profit use by charities and public-interest
        organizations;
    (d) free distribution with no direct or indirect commercial gain and
        without advertising or paywalls.

1.5 "Derivative Work" means any work created by modifying, translating,
    adapting, merging or redistributing all or part of the Software.

2. Grant

Subject to full compliance with this License, the Copyright Holder grants
you a worldwide, royalty-free, non-exclusive, non-sublicensable license to
use, copy and modify the Software; to combine it with other works; and to
publish and distribute it and derivative works — for Non-Commercial
purposes only.

3. Conditions: Full Source and Attribution

3.1 You must retain this License in full and all original copyright notices
    in every copy and derivative work.

3.2 You must prominently state the nature and date of any modifications.

3.3 Mandatory full disclosure. Whenever you distribute the Software or a
    derivative work in any form — including compiled APK, binaries,
    installers, container images, or as an online service — you must:
    (a) provide the complete, buildable corresponding source code,
        including all of your modifications, with nothing removed,
        obfuscated, encrypted or partially withheld;
    (b) make that source code publicly, freely and durably available
        (e.g. a public repository) and state its exact location in the
